  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Direct Coffee Import from Ethiopia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">In order to be able to scale up Almacena has imported 2 containers of coffee beans from a firs time exporter from Ethiopia with the help of DGGF-TA financing. Almacena offers full traceability on the supply chain for their purchased beans and the company focusses on paying increasing the income of the smallholder farmers they purchase from. 350 farmers were linked to these shipments and 1 person was trained during the period of the TA.</narrative>
  </description>
